    caseBasedQuestions: [{ id: 1, title: 'Bleeding Gums after Viper Bite', scenario: 'Farmer bitten by Russell\'s viper shows oozing bite wound and unclotted 20WBCT blood.', questions: ['Venom type? ASV dose?'], solution: 'Vasculotoxic / Hemotoxic venom; 10 Vials Polyvalent ASV IV.', legalSections: ['Snakebite Protocols'] }],
    summary: 'Chapter 27 covers India\'s Big Four snakes, neurotoxic elapids, hemotoxic vipers, 20WBCT, polyvalent ASV, and scorpion prazosin therapy.',
