      'Master Datura stramonium / fastuosa (Thorn Apple / Roadside Poison): Tropane alkaloids (Atropine, Scopolamine, Hyoscyamine), Anticholinergic toxidrome ("Mad as a hatter, Red as a beet, Dry as a bone, Hot as a hare, Blind as a bat"), Stupefying poison in robbery/travelers, Physostigmine antidote.',
